@Spowmtom this issue is for `3.x`.
@SlothDevLlama currently runtime baking happens on a separate thread so you need to export your HTML5 project with threading support: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/export/exporting_for_web.html#threads

Btw. @SlothDevLlama please don't close this issue - we either need to document baking better or introduce some runtime switch taking threading support into account
